[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1175","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1175.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1545","title":"Joe's Own Editor joe 许可设置漏洞","description":"Joe's Own Editor (joe) 2.8 版本在崩溃时生成的临时保存文件 DEADJOE 权限设置为世界可读，导致本地攻击者可读取其他用户正在编辑的敏感文件内容。该漏洞利用条件简单，攻击者只需具备本地用户权限即可访问目标文件，影响使用 joe 2.8 编辑器的系统，属于信息泄露类漏洞，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1545"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-07-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:41Z","remediation":"升级 joe 至 3.1 及以上版本，该版本已默认限制 DEADJOE 文件权限为仅属主可读。如无法升级，在 .bashrc 中设置 umask 077 后再启动 joe，或编写 cron 脚本定期清理 /tmp 下的 DEADJOE 文件并设置 chmod 600。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93216103027827&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93226771401036&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9bf1bcd98df741ae892c1ba6b8127fb5da623fcc/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1545.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1545","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1545.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be827cc2d99405b0a015aad2694b62cec4eb4f9e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1545.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a3495eb833b3f1f2096187c4b14884afc98b67a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hmj8-www5-pjq9/GHSA-hmj8-www5-pjq9.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x85000/84451/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1545.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153500_153600.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000695.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1175.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1175.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1116","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1116.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1460","title":"BMC PATROL SNMP Agent 本地文件创建致权限提升漏洞","description":"BMC Software Patrol SNMP Agent 3.2.07 之前版本存在权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 snmpmagt 程序传递目标文件路径作为第二个参数，以 root 权限创建任意全局可写文件，进而实现本地权限提升或系统文件篡改。该漏洞影响 Patrol 3.2.5 及更早版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1460"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-07-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:29Z","remediation":"升级 BMC PATROL SNMP Agent 到 3.2.07 及以上版本，此版本修复了 snmpmagt 程序参数校验缺陷。如无法升级，限制本地用户对 snmpmagt 二进制文件的执行权限，仅允许受信管理员账户使用。同时监控 /tmp 等目录下异常的世界可写文件创建行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93198293132463&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93372579004129&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/525","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19422","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5102a7cca13b4c0a0e55e628783c406707da47e/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1460.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1460","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1460.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cba6a622b2958fa1ec3a506e7b58871edec19fb/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1460.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/78550cb05ca9623089e78169330acf979f4b64ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j5w8-q6hm-5q59/GHSA-j5w8-q6hm-5q59.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/525/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1460.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--89b0409e-90f4-4b11-9af5-34cb7181ddff.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1116.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0995","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0995.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1166","title":"Linux Kernel 2.0.37 Segment Limit 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux Kernel 2.0.37 版本中存在段限制（Segment Limit）编码缺陷漏洞，由于内核未正确编码自定义段限制，导致本地攻击者能够通过访问和修改内核内存来提升权限至 root。该漏洞影响 Linux Kernel 2.0.37 版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。目前官方已发布更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1166"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-07-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:51Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.x 或更高版本，该漏洞在内核 2.0.38 及之后版本中已被修复。由于 2.0.x 系列已停止维护，建议升级至仍受支持的内核分支（如 2.6.x 或更新版本）。如无法升级内核，可通过 grsecurity/PaX 等内核加固补丁限制本地用户访问内核内存空间作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/18156","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/523","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19419","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1166.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1166","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1166.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d0a8c476da89b37a2bbb6193b7964b10d03aff75/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1166.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8cc4-2w6x-64qg/GHSA-8cc4-2w6x-64qg.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/523/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1166.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153500_153600.json","https://github.com/shamedgh/confine/blob/a75dad3ad336e6258a42cd1ce4af061eea68ed76/cve.files/cveToFile.json.type.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d8e06286-da34-4b52-b892-6e49e4aafd25.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0995.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0995.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0995.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1174","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1174.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1543","title":"Apple Mac OS 8 弱密码加密漏洞","description":"Apple Mac OS 8 及 8.6 版本的 Users & Groups Data File 中存储的用户密码使用了弱加密算法，攻击者在获取本地文件访问权限后可读取该文件并对加密后的密码哈希进行破解，导致用户凭证泄露。该漏洞影响 Mac OS 8/8.6 系统，攻击者需具备本地或远程文件读取能力，利用难度较低，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1543"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-07-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:40Z","remediation":"Mac OS 8.6 及更早版本已停止安全支持，建议立即升级到受支持的 macOS 版本（如 macOS 14 Sonoma 或更高版本），这些版本使用更强健的密码哈希算法（如 SHA-512 派生密钥）。对于无法升级的遗留系统，应限制该系统的网络暴露范围，将其隔离在独立的 VLAN 中，并对所有本地账户启用强密码策略（长度≥12 位，包含大小写字母、数字和特殊字符）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93188174906513&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93736667813924&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/519","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19417","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9bf1bcd98df741ae892c1ba6b8127fb5da623fcc/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1543.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1543","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1543.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be827cc2d99405b0a015aad2694b62cec4eb4f9e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1543.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a3495eb833b3f1f2096187c4b14884afc98b67a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4cvf-99qg-vwq4/GHSA-4cvf-99qg-vwq4.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153500_153600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5dbf3673-c284-41c3-937d-5a583aa11b9a.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1543.json","https://github.com/SecurityTapestry-Queen/nvd-cve-api-search/blob/345948b33da9e35fec240da3598d652f39870f4e/archive/2025-04-05/report-04-05-2025-21-01-24.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1174.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0574","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0574.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0809","title":"Netscape Communicator 4.x 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 4.x 在启用 JavaScript 时存在安全绕过漏洞，即使用户设置了\"仅接受来自同一服务器的 cookie\"选项，浏览器也不会对 cookie 设置发出警告。攻击者可通过恶意 JavaScript 代码绕过同源策略限制，在用户不知情的情况下设置或读取跨域 cookie，导致隐私泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞影响 Netscape Communicator 4.x 所有启用 JavaScript 的版本，攻击者需诱导用户访问包含恶意脚本的页面即可触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，属中危漏洞。Netscape 已在后续版本中修复此同源策略绕过问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0809"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-07-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:06Z","remediation":"升级到 Netscape Communicator 4.51 或更高版本以修复该 cookie 安全设置提示缺陷；在无法立即升级时，可在浏览器偏好设置中关闭 JavaScript 功能，或手动将 cookie 接受策略设置为\"仅接受来自同一服务器的 cookie\"，以缓解隐私泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0809","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5b55afba6f3a87fe9319e1de76170e4c2760d614/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0809.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0809","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0809.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/57cb981038a97031bd95a35a9b10bbed18ca4725/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0809.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/90b464bbc2d1b64270a5771429f96b67fbe9e79b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h6pv-h65g-hmwg/GHSA-h6pv-h65g-hmwg.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0809.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000692.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0809.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0574.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1171","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1171.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1537","title":"Microsoft IIS 3.0/4.0 SSL 资源耗尽拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 3.0 及 4.0 版本存在 SSL 资源耗尽拒绝服务漏洞。由于 IIS 无法区分需要加密传输的页面与不需要加密的页面，远程攻击者可通过向 HTTPS 端口发送大量针对非加密文件的 SSL 请求，迫使 IIS 执行额外的 SSL 加密操作来传输这些文件，导致服务器 CPU 和内存资源被大量消耗，最终造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 IIS 3.x 和 4.x 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1537"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-07-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:39Z","remediation":"升级到 IIS 5.0 或更高版本（如 IIS 6.0/7.0/7.5/8.0/8.5/10.0），这些版本已区分加密与非加密页面请求，避免不必要的 SSL 加密开销。如无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制单个 IP 对 HTTPS 端口的并发连接数（如限制为 100 个/分钟），并启用连接速率限制作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=93138827329577&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/521","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2352","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9bf1bcd98df741ae892c1ba6b8127fb5da623fcc/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1537.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1537","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1537.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84a8576323536424cfe4fe56907ba66e1ea3a744/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1537.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a3495eb833b3f1f2096187c4b14884afc98b67a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-54rf-m93w-vh4v/GHSA-54rf-m93w-vh4v.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/1xxx/cve-1999-1537.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1